            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chris"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe. The only change was the use of a Memphis Rib Rub in lieu of the cajun seasoning. Otherwise, I followed the recipe exactly and the ribs turned out great!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sfought"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I skipped the vinegar and used beef broth instead. Fat tire ale is my beer of choice for cooking. I peeled 6 cloves of garlic for it, used baby carrots, and a BBQ rub I found at a festival. It turned out great. The meat just fell off the bones. Thank you!",
            "datePublished": "2021-11-25T18:21:41.900Z"
          },
          {
